{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09298","headline":"悲故交 · 韦应物","name":"悲故交","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白璧衆求瑕，素丝易成污。\n万里颠沛还，高堂已长暮。\n积愤方盈抱，缠哀忽逾度。\n念子从此终，黄泉竟谁诉。\n一爲时事感，岂独平生故。\n唯见荒丘原，野草涂朝露。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}